    "defense": "Algeria defend with aggression and speed. Rayan Aït-Nouri gives them quality from the left side, and the team likes to stay active rather than simply sit back.",
    "midfield": "The midfield mixes hard work with flair. Algeria want to move the ball quickly and give their creative players a chance to run at defenders before the game slows down.",
    "attack": "Algeria attack with skill and direct running. Mahrez still gives them star power, and their young players add the kind of fearless energy that can shake up bigger teams.",
    "goalkeeper_note": "Anthony Mandrea is the goalkeeper name to know for Algeria right now. He is not the biggest star, but he gives them an important steady base behind an adventurous team.",
